#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/index.rst:2
msgid "Developing a basic TODO application"
msgstr "开发一个基础的 TODO 应用程序"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/index.rst:4
msgid "Who is this tutorial for?"
msgstr "本教程适合哪些人？"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/index.rst:7
msgid ""
"This tutorial is intended to familiarize you with the basic concepts of "
"Litestar. If you have no prior experience with Litestar or web frameworks in "
"general, this is the right place to start."
msgstr ""
"本教程旨在帮助你熟悉 Litestar 的基本概念。如果你此前没有使用过 Litestar，或者"
"对 Web 框架整体上还不熟悉，那么这里将是一个很好的起点。"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/index.rst:12
msgid "Basic knowledge of Python and web development concepts are required."
msgstr "需要具备 Python 基础知识以及 Web 开发的基本概念。"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/index.rst:15
msgid ""
"The goal of this tutorial is to develop a TODO application with the "
"following functionalities:"
msgstr "本教程的目标是开发一个具备以下功能的 TODO 应用程序："

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/index.rst:18
msgid "Retrieve a TODO list"
msgstr "获取 TODO 列表"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/index.rst:19
msgid "Add items to a TODO list"
msgstr "向 TODO 列表添加条目"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/index.rst:20
msgid "Mark TODO items as *done*"
msgstr "将 TODO 条目标记为*已完成*"

#: ../../../tutorials/todo-app/index.rst:22
msgid ""
"This is not a whole lot of functionality, but enough to learn most of the "
"fundamental building blocks of Litestar."
msgstr "虽然功能并不算多，但已经足以帮助你学习 Litestar 的大部分核心基础组件。"
